ObservationEvent (environment)
  Tool: finish
  Result: Added fix in src/strands/tools/decorator.py in DecoratedFunctionTool.__call__ method to call `model_rebuild()` on the Pydantic model if available before input validation. This addresses the Pydantic 2.12.0+ compatibility issue that causes incomplete model definition errors when using @tool with typing.Literal.

No direct tests were run, but the fix matches the issue and common Pydantic 2.12 migration workaround.

Please test with Pydantic 2.12+ to confirm the fix resolves the bug in your environ...
